{"ref":"character:guardian-pina","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Guardian Pina is a playable character from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors. Their starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Clear_Debris.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clear-debris"}," ",{"t":"Clear Debris","r":"weapon:clear-debris"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Guardian"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["C1_GUARDIAN"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["C1_Guardian"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Clear_Debris.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:clear-debris"}," ",{"t":"Clear Debris","r":"weapon:clear-debris"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Defeat 1 enemy with Ghost Lino?!"]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-No_Ghosts_Among_Us.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"No Ghosts Among Us\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["0.10"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Revival","cells":[["+1"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Guardian is unlocked for purchase by defeating 1 enemy with ",{"i":"Sprite-Ghost_Lino.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"character:ghost-lino"}," ",{"t":"Ghost Lino","r":"character:ghost-lino"},". They need to be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Guardian can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"foundblueinstorage\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Guardian starts with +0.1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},", +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", and +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},". Guardian provides +1 Armor and +0.3 Recovery to nearby characters. They can walk through walls."]},{"k":"p","c":["Guardian has a 50% chance, unaffected by ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", to gain +1 Revival when anyone spends a revival, including themselves."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["In general, Guardian is a much stronger character in multiplayer due to their chance to gain a Revival when anyone revives and their Recovery and Armor benefits to nearby characters."]},{"c":["Since Revivals are essentially 50% more efficient on Guardian, ",{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," is a strong choice for them, especially in multiplayer."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Phieraggi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Meal_Ticket.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," ",{"t":"Meal Ticket","r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," are both powerful options for Guardian because of their 50% chance to effectively not consume a Revival when they normally would, and their potential for extra Revives in multiplayer."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Guardian_Pina.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Guardian Pina's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Guardian_Pina.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Guardian_Pina_-_trailer.png","w":149,"h":150,"c":["Guardian Pina as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1WMUJ_YMPlY"}," of Emergency Meeting."]},{"i":"Emergency_Meeting.png","w":200,"h":113,"c":["Guardian Pina as seen in the cover art of Emergency Meeting (top left)."]}]}]}]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Guardian Angel","x":"https://among-us.fandom.com/wiki/Guardian_Angel"}," at the ",{"t":" Among Us Wiki","x":"https://among-us.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}